{"text": "HyberX is described as the first AI that sits beside users, sees their screen, and solves the moment they are actually living in.", "dimensions": ["objectives", "strategy", "innovation", "feasibility"], "type": "market", "primary_dimension": "objectives", "meta": {"proposal_id": "kt70__openai", "chunk_index": 0, "char_start": 0, "char_end": 1800}}
{"text": "The project highlights the problem of users facing technology they do not fully understand.", "dimensions": ["objectives", "strategy", "feasibility"], "type": "market", "primary_dimension": "objectives", "meta": {"proposal_id": "kt70__openai", "chunk_index": 0, "char_start": 0, "char_end": 1800}}
{"text": "The text mentions that billions of people encounter screens full of things they don't fully understand every day.", "dimensions": ["objectives"], "type": "other", "primary_dimension": "objectives", "meta": {"proposal_id": "kt70__openai", "chunk_index": 0, "char_start": 0, "char_end": 1800}}
{"text": "The project criticizes the current state of technology support, suggesting that the burden of translating technology falls on non-technical users.", "dimensions": ["objectives", "strategy", "feasibility"], "type": "market", "primary_dimension": "objectives", "meta": {"proposal_id": "kt70__openai", "chunk_index": 0, "char_start": 0, "char_end": 1800}}
{"text": "HyberX is described as the first AI that actually sees what you're going through.", "dimensions": ["innovation"], "type": "other", "primary_dimension": "innovation", "meta": {"proposal_id": "kt70__openai", "chunk_index": 1, "char_start": 1400, "char_end": 3200}}
{"text": "HyberX opens and looks at your screen in real-time to understand the user's issue instantly.", "dimensions": ["objectives", "strategy", "innovation", "feasibility"], "type": "market", "primary_dimension": "objectives", "meta": {"proposal_id": "kt70__openai", "chunk_index": 1, "char_start": 1400, "char_end": 3200}}
{"text": "HyberX guides users step by step in plain human language until the problem is resolved.", "dimensions": ["objectives", "strategy", "innovation", "feasibility"], "type": "market", "primary_dimension": "objectives", "meta": {"proposal_id": "kt70__openai", "chunk_index": 1, "char_start": 1400, "char_end": 3200}}
{"text": "The proposal highlights a crisis in the modern workplace where non-technical users struggle with technology.", "dimensions": ["objectives", "strategy", "feasibility"], "type": "market", "primary_dimension": "objectives", "meta": {"proposal_id": "kt70__openai", "chunk_index": 1, "char_start": 1400, "char_end": 3200}}
{"text": "The text suggests that even engineers face challenges when using technology, particularly during stressful situations.", "dimensions": ["feasibility"], "type": "other", "primary_dimension": "feasibility", "meta": {"proposal_id": "kt70__openai", "chunk_index": 1, "char_start": 1400, "char_end": 3200}}
{"text": "HyberX aims to eliminate the need for users to describe problems they can barely see.", "dimensions": ["objectives", "strategy", "feasibility"], "type": "market", "primary_dimension": "objectives", "meta": {"proposal_id": "kt70__openai", "chunk_index": 1, "char_start": 1400, "char_end": 3200}}
{"text": "The proposal criticizes the current state of technology support, which often leaves users feeling isolated.", "dimensions": ["objectives", "strategy", "feasibility"], "type": "market", "primary_dimension": "objectives", "meta": {"proposal_id": "kt70__openai", "chunk_index": 1, "char_start": 1400, "char_end": 3200}}
{"text": "HyberX is described as the world's first real-time AI system.", "dimensions": ["innovation"], "type": "other", "primary_dimension": "innovation", "meta": {"proposal_id": "kt70__openai", "chunk_index": 2, "char_start": 2800, "char_end": 4600}}
{"text": "HyberX is not a feature or a plugin, but a new category of product.", "dimensions": ["innovation"], "type": "other", "primary_dimension": "innovation", "meta": {"proposal_id": "kt70__openai", "chunk_index": 2, "char_start": 2800, "char_end": 4600}}
{"text": "The creators of HyberX believe that the next decade of AI will be won by models that understand context like a human colleague.", "dimensions": ["innovation"], "type": "other", "primary_dimension": "innovation", "meta": {"proposal_id": "kt70__openai", "chunk_index": 2, "char_start": 2800, "char_end": 4600}}
{"text": "HyberX is positioned as a true real-time co-pilot for the human experience of using a computer.", "dimensions": ["innovation"], "type": "other", "primary_dimension": "innovation", "meta": {"proposal_id": "kt70__openai", "chunk_index": 2, "char_start": 2800, "char_end": 4600}}
{"text": "HyberX aims to help users who feel stuck or frustrated while using their computers.", "dimensions": ["objectives", "strategy", "feasibility"], "type": "market", "primary_dimension": "objectives", "meta": {"proposal_id": "kt70__openai", "chunk_index": 2, "char_start": 2800, "char_end": 4600}}
{"text": "The product is currently in a beta phase and invites users to join.", "dimensions": ["objectives", "strategy", "feasibility"], "type": "market", "primary_dimension": "objectives", "meta": {"proposal_id": "kt70__openai", "chunk_index": 2, "char_start": 2800, "char_end": 4600}}
{"text": "The development of HyberX faces technical challenges, particularly in screen-awareness.", "dimensions": ["feasibility"], "type": "risk", "primary_dimension": "feasibility", "meta": {"proposal_id": "kt70__openai", "chunk_index": 2, "char_start": 2800, "char_end": 4600}}
{"text": "HyberX was built to assist users who have experienced frustration with computer errors.", "dimensions": ["objectives", "strategy", "feasibility"], "type": "market", "primary_dimension": "objectives", "meta": {"proposal_id": "kt70__openai", "chunk_index": 3, "char_start": 4200, "char_end": 6000}}
{"text": "Teaching an AI to understand any screen, including every app and layout, is a core challenge for HyberX.", "dimensions": ["feasibility"], "type": "risk", "primary_dimension": "feasibility", "meta": {"proposal_id": "kt70__openai", "chunk_index": 3, "char_start": 4200, "char_end": 6000}}
{"text": "HyberX's early builds effectively handle the common 80% of screen types.", "dimensions": ["feasibility"], "type": "other", "primary_dimension": "feasibility", "meta": {"suspect_numeric": false, "proposal_id": "kt70__openai", "chunk_index": 3, "char_start": 4200, "char_end": 6000}}
{"text": "Closing the last 20% of screen understanding will require continued training, user feedback, and time.", "dimensions": ["objectives", "strategy", "feasibility"], "type": "market", "primary_dimension": "objectives", "meta": {"suspect_numeric": false, "proposal_id": "kt70__openai", "chunk_index": 3, "char_start": 4200, "char_end": 6000}}
{"text": "HyberX may sometimes misread a screen or provide inaccurate guidance.", "dimensions": ["feasibility"], "type": "risk", "primary_dimension": "feasibility", "meta": {"proposal_id": "kt70__openai", "chunk_index": 3, "char_start": 4200, "char_end": 6000}}
{"text": "Every response from HyberX is clearly marked as AI-generated.", "dimensions": ["innovation"], "type": "other", "primary_dimension": "innovation", "meta": {"proposal_id": "kt70__openai", "chunk_index": 3, "char_start": 4200, "char_end": 6000}}
{"text": "HyberX is developing confidence indicators to help users know when to double-check AI responses.", "dimensions": ["objectives", "strategy", "innovation", "feasibility"], "type": "market", "primary_dimension": "objectives", "meta": {"proposal_id": "kt70__openai", "chunk_index": 3, "char_start": 4200, "char_end": 6000}}
